- one C22.0 plus another independent HCC-specific source and no stronger competing indication.

## PROBABLE_HCC

Examples:
- one C22.0 plus strongly compatible treatment context;
- C22.8/C22.9 plus explicit HCC terminology elsewhere;
- HCC-specific treatment plan terminology without a coded C22.0 but otherwise convincing evidence.

