Insufficient evidence to confidently establish whether treatment was HCC-directed.

## NON_HCC

Evidence indicates the index regimen was treating another malignancy.

Examples:
- NSCLC Beacon plan plus Atezo/Bev/platinum/taxane pattern;
- NSCLC Beacon plan plus durvalumab/tremelimumab/platinum pattern;
- another explicit malignancy treatment plan with no meaningful HCC evidence.

